Zeta potential of COM crystal Zeta potentials of COM crystals of different sizes were examined. In this work, 3 mg of COM crystals was weighed and dispersed in 6 mL of ethyl alcohol or RPMI-1640 culture medium. The zeta potential of the samples was determined using a Zetasizer Nano ZS laser nanoparticle size analyzer.

Statistical analysis Data are presented as means ± SD. The number of individual experiments is indicated in the Figures or figure legends. One-way ANOVA was used for statistical analysis by SPSS 13.0 software. In all Figures, significance was defined as follows: *P < 0.05, **P < 0.01, ***P < 0.001. P ≥ 0.05 were considered not significant.

